e16ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         How many new restaurants are there, do you know?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Last time I checked, there were at least twenty. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Twenty! That's got to be really worrying! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Your reaction is stronger than mine and I'm the one who has a restaurant!", "time": "22000", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:          What time is it?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     It's 1:30. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Really? Oh no! The reservation was for 1:00. I lost track of time!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Do you have the phone number? We can call and cancel.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Let's just walk over. There's a path through the museum.", "time": "37000", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le16ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     Ooh! Look, there's a new exhibition coming next month! We have to go!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Which exhibition? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:     The Matthew Barney one. He does art installations as well. He is a famous sculptor.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Ah, here's the restaurant. I'll go in and make sure the reservation is cancelled. I feel like going somewhere else anyway.", "time": "53000", "id": 4, "image": "engenn7le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le16ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le16ob04re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}]}]}